apps/3720630/extras/4e2a5faad016ec328812403e5cbea8d5.mp4?t=1763103583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🃏 50+ cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/6919af0818870043105076b8ef1b45e8.avif?t=1763103583\" width=671 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy to the cards you unlock each game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏛️ 40+ buildings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/e80a60fdd4f322245fde1c6bbb78dce8.avif?t=1763103583\" width=671 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete buildings to unlock more powerful cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📜 20+ state policies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/21bc6c3411683d5b18e113deabadd933.avif?t=1763103583\" width=671 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right policies to synergise with your deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 10+ revolutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/5a0419f3a17c38c2ea7558dcd1419148.avif?t=1763103583\" width=671 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the revolutions that will mess with your deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
